			"notes": "## [0.2.0] - 2026-10-26\n\n### Features\n- Cobblemon 1.8.3 support\n- Added 'negate' requirement, that accepts inner requirement it should negate against\n- Added 'game_mode' requirement that will check game mode of current player\n- Added 'player_held_item' requirement that will check held item of current player, like 'owner_held_item'\n\n### Optimizations\n- Made 'match_all' and 'match_any' player aware to pass the player down\n- Changed 'permission_node' requirement to be aware of current player\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/gitoido-mc/conditional-riding/compare/v0.1.5...v0.2.0"
